          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hear ye the word which the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.10.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.10.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "speaketh unto you, O house of Israel:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thus saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.10.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.10.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", Learn not the way of the heathen, and be not dismayed at the signs of heaven; for the heathen are dismayed at them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For the customs of the people",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.10.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.10.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "vain: for",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "one",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.10.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.10.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "cutteth a tree out of the forest, the work of the hands of the workman, with the axe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They deck it with silver and with gold; they fasten it with nails and with hammers, that it move not.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.10.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.10.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "upright as the palm tree, but speak not: they must needs be borne, because they cannot go. Be not afraid of them; for they cannot do evil, neither also",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.10.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.10.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in them to do good.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Forasmuch as",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.10.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.10.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "none like unto thee, O",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.10.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.10.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; thou",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "art",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.10.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.10.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "great, and thy name",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.10.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.10.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "great in might.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Who would not fear thee, O King of nations? for to thee doth it appertain: forasmuch as among all the wise",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "men",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.10.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.10.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of the nations, and in all their kingdoms,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.10.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.10.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "none like unto thee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But they are altogether brutish and foolish: the stock",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.10.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.10.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a doctrine of vanities.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Silver spread into plates is brought from Tarshish, and gold from Uphaz, the work of the workman, and of the hands of the founder: blue and purple",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.10.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.10.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "their clothing: they",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.10.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.10.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "all the work of cunning",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "men",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.10.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.10.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.10.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.10.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.10.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.10.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the true God, he",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.10.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.10.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the living God, and an everlasting king: at his wrath the earth shall tremble, and the nations shall not be able to abide his indignation.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thus shall ye say unto them, The gods that have not made the heavens and the earth,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "even",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.10.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.10.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "they shall perish from the earth, and from under these heavens.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He hath made the earth by his power, he hath established the world by his wisdom, and hath stretched out the heavens by his discretion.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When he uttereth his voice,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.10.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.10.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a multitude of waters in the heavens, and he causeth the vapours to ascend from the ends of the earth; he maketh lightnings with rain, and bringeth forth the wind out of his treasures.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Every man is brutish in",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "his",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.10.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.10.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "knowledge: every founder is confounded by the graven image: for his molten image",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
